{"id":"8d6b9a109949","publishedAt":1794596400000,"posts":[[{"bold":true,"text":"【王将戦】藤本渚七段が本田奎七段に勝ち、４勝１敗に"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-category-4.html","text":"王将戦"},{"text":" \n 2026/11/13"},{"text":"19:00"},{"text":"49"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"text":"\n藤本　渚（４勝１敗） ○－● 本田　奎（２勝３敗）　\n"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://blog-imgs-187.fc2.com/i/2/c/i2chmeijin/202611131151535c0.png"},{"br":1},{"size":13,"href":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/oushou/76/hon.html","text":"https://www.shogi.or.jp/match/oushou/76/hon.html"},{"br":1},{"color":"#333333","size":13,"text":"スポンサーリンク"}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 藤本おめ本田乙ということで "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 永瀬は勝てば挑戦か藤本とPO　負けると伊藤匠とPOか2位残留 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 郷田、本田は勝てば残留(PO)負けると陥落 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 藤本は勝てば挑戦か永瀬とPO　負けると3位残留 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 伊藤匠は勝てば2位残留か永瀬とPO　負けると3位残留 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 抜け番西田は郷田、本田負けで残留 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 近藤は陥落決定済み "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 消化試合ではないが永瀬が負ける可能性を含めてキャンセル待ちだからね "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" 最近藤井が雁木を指さないだけにイトタクの研究がゆき届いているか "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" イトタクはまず順位戦… "}],[{"bold":true,"size":16,"text":" そろそろ藤本にも洗礼をだな "},{"br":1},{"size":10,"text":"\n引用元："},{"size":10,"text":"https://mevius.5ch.io/test/read.cgi/bgame/1791280216/"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24088.html?sp&m2=form","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24088.html?sp&m2=form","text":"を書く"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24088.html?sp&m2=res","text":"コメント"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://i2chmeijin.com/blog-entry-24088.html?sp&m2=res","text":"(49)"}]],"comments":[]}